#: 
msgid "Protecting your privacy has always been one of the foundations for TailorGuide."
msgstr "Yksityisyyden suojaaminen on aina ollut yksi kulmakivistä TailorGuidella."

#: 
msgid "We not only comply with privacy laws, but also go beyond this by making privacy a key requirement in our engineering."
